# Build context hygiene — keeps host node_modules, build output and secrets
# out of the image so builds are reproducible and small.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/*.log

.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Not needed to build or run the server image
desktop/
infra/
*.zip
README.md
client/screenshot-preview.html
client/package.json.replit-reference
